# What the demos leave behind: `gcc dot.c main.c` writes a.out, `make` writes
# the binaries perf measures, the matvec pages build matvec_scalar and
# matvec_avx2, and the other examples write the program named in their
# header comment. The .o, .i and .s files are ignored by the
# top-level .gitignore.
a.out
add
dot_scalar
dot_avx2
dot_product
dot_dbg
dot_rec
echo
echo_sp
dot_intrin
dot_omp
dot_cuda
matvec_scalar
matvec_avx2
equal
shift
max
times
*.exe
